  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "er ealle Gyt \u00f0u h\u00e6fst min folc, & nelt hit forl\u00e6tan, Witodlice nu to morgen on \u00feysse ylcan tide ic sende So\u00f0lice send nu rihte & gegadera ealle \u00feine nytenu & ealle \u00feine \u00feing \u00f0e \u00f0u on \u00e6cere h\u00e6fst: witodlice Se \u00f0e Drihtnes wordes ondred of Faraones folce, se fleah mid hys mannum & nytenum in to husum. & se \u00f0e Drihtnes word forgymde, he forlet his menn & hys nytenu ute. & Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Ahefe upp \u00feine hand, \u00fe\u00e6t hagol gewur\u00f0e ofer eall Egypta land & ofer & Moyses a\u00f0enode his gyrde upp, & Drihten sende \u00feunorrada & hagol & byrnende ligeta ofer eal & Drihten let rinan hagol wi\u00f0 fyr gemenged & hi ferdon \u00e6tg\u00e6dere, & swa micel he w\u00e6s swa n\u00e6fre & se hagol sloh on eallum Egypta lande ealle \u00f0a \u00f0ing \u00fee ute w\u00e6ron, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge menn ge nytenu, & eal & on Gessen lande, \u00fe\u00e6r Israhela bearn w\u00e6ron, ne com nan d\u00e6l \u00f0\u00e6s hagoles. \u00d0a sende Pharao to Moyse & to Aarone, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him: Ic winne ongean Drihten; ic wat \u00fe\u00e6t ic & Bidda\u00f0 Drihten \u00fe\u00e6t hys \u00feunorrada & \u00f0es hagol geswicon, & ic wille eow forl\u00e6tan & ge ne \u00feurfon her Moyses cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00feonne ic ut ga of \u00f0issere byrig, ic ahebbe up mine hand to Drihtne & \u00fea \u00f0unorrada & Ic wat so\u00f0lice \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u & \u00f0in folc",
